@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-67 - Export Analytics Report

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Analytics UI" as FE
control "AnalyticsController" as API
control "AnalyticsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-67
FE -> API: Analytics export endpoint recommended
API -> Service: Execute Export Analytics Report
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: File báo cáo được tải xuống

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở dashboard
Post: File báo cáo được tải xuống
Main flow:
1. Admin bấm Export
2. System generate PDF/CSV report
3. System trả về file download
end note
@enduml
